##### Score Rationale

Give 3-8 concise evidence-based bullets explaining the most important reasons.

At least one bullet should mention evidence confidence when it is materially limited.

## 8. Session Scores

- Roleplay Quality: X/10
- Group Chemistry: X/10
- Pacing: X/10
- Immersion: X/10
- Dramatic Energy: X/10
- Narrative Progress: X/10
- Overall Session Quality: X/10

