Give 3-6 concise bullets.

## 9. Trend Summary

Finish with a compact machine-readable block.

The field names and formatting below must remain exactly in English, regardless of the language of the rest of the review.

Do not add commentary inside this block.

Use numeric values without /10.

Use NONE exactly when there is no Inspiration Moment.

Use the most stable available participant names.

```text
SESSION_MVP: [Name]
INSPIRATION_MOMENT: [Name or NONE]
